@title S2 EP 04 • COVER STORY
@bg dorm_room_night
@show nia
11:40 p.m. Nia's at your door.
Nia: Riley said she's here studying.
You look at your empty dorm room. Nia looks at your empty dorm room.
Nia: ...She's at the basketball house, isn't she.
> [Good] Tell Nia the truth. -> c1
> [Bad] "She went to get food. She'll be right back." -> c2
> [Sweet] "Nia... why do you care so much where she is?" -> c3
> [Bitchy] "Not your business. You're not her girlfriend." -> c4
*c1
@add Nia_Friendship 3
@add Riley_Friendship -2
@add Riley_Trust -1
Nia: (already walking) Thank you. Come with me.
@jump c_done
*c2
@add Riley_Friendship 2
@add Nia_Friendship -2
@add Two_Faced 1
Nia sits on your bed. "Okay. I'll wait." She waits for two hours. Riley never comes.
@jump c_done
*c3
@add Nia_Friendship 3
@add Nia_Secret 1
Nia goes very still. Then she sits down on the edge of your bed like her legs gave out.
Nia: Because I'm in love with her. And she's at a party trying to get some point guard to notice her. That's why.
@jump c_done
*c4
@add Nia_Friendship -3
@add Nia_Secret 1
Nia: (flat) No. I'm not. Thanks for reminding me.
The door closes softly. Somehow that's worse than slamming.
*c_done
@bg basketball_house_night
@show riley
The basketball house is loud and sticky. Riley is on the kitchen counter. Tyler from basketball is standing between her knees.
Yes. THAT Tyler. Brooke's Tyler. Jacket Tyler.
@show brooke
And Brooke is walking up the driveway.
> [Bold] Get Riley out the back door. Now. -> h1
> [Bad] Let it happen. This is going to be incredible. -> h2
> [Good] Intercept Brooke at the front door. -> h3
> [Bitchy] Text the whole team "lmaooo come to the bball house rn" -> h4
*h1
@add Riley_Friendship 3
@add Riley_Trust 2
Riley: (shoving shoes on, laughing) You're like a getaway driver! I love you! I'm so stupid!
You make it to the car. Brooke never sees her. Probably.
@jump h_done
*h2
@add Drama 3
@add Brooke_Friendship -2
@add Riley_Friendship -2
Brooke walks in. Sees. Doesn't yell. Takes a picture, then another, then leaves without a word.
That's the scariest thing anyone's done all season.
@add Brooke_Has_Photo 1
@jump h_done
*h3
@add Brooke_Friendship 2
@add Brooke_Grudge -1
Sasha: Brooke! Hey! You look amazing. Wanna get tacos?
Brooke: (eyes narrowing) ...Why are you being nice to me?
Sasha: Growth.
@jump h_done
